{
  "id": "c1-e45-tradition-for-sale",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Tradition for sale",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, which traditions are most important in your family?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, have you noticed celebrations becoming more commercial?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what is your favourite time of year, and why?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think young people in your country take part in traditional celebrations?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e45-a1",
            "c1-e45-a2",
            "c1-e45-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show different sides of a tradition. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people involved might value, and how these traditions might be changing.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these do you feel is closest to the real spirit of a tradition?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e45-b1",
            "c1-e45-b2",
            "c1-e45-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people celebrating or watching celebrations. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might get out of the occasion, and whether they are experiencing something genuine.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think tourists should be allowed to take part in local festivals?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some factors that influence whether a tradition survives, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e45-tradition-for-sale",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these factors affect the survival of traditions?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6900
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e45-tradition-for-sale",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most important?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about traditions and commercialisation.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it inevitable that traditions lose their meaning when they become big business?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should local people decide how their traditions are presented to visitors?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think traditions have to change in order to survive?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How have modern lifestyles altered the way families celebrate?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is it acceptable for companies to use traditional symbols to sell products?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should some traditions be ended because they are out of date?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e45-tradition-for-sale/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
